  "units": [
    {
      "paragraph_id": "no-longer-human-zh-p00210",
      "unit_index": 1,
      "source_text": "善惡的概念是人類創造出來的，是人類擅自創造出來的道德詞語。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "The concepts of good and evil are human creations, moral words that humans invented on their own.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "no-longer-human-zh-p00210",
      "unit_index": 2,
      "source_text": "」「你好煩人啊。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "\"You are so annoying.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "no-longer-human-zh-p00210",
      "unit_index": 3,
      "source_text": "既然如此，那就是神吧，是神。是神。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "If that is so, then it must be God, right? God. God.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "no-longer-human-zh-p00210",
      "unit_index": 4,
      "source_text": "把一切都歸功於神是沒錯。呀，我肚子好餓啊。」",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "You cannot go wrong by attributing everything to God. Ah, I am so hungry.\"",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "no-longer-human-zh-p00210",
      "unit_index": 5,
      "source_text": "「良子正在樓下煮著蠶豆呢。」",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "\"Yoshiko is downstairs boiling broad beans.\"",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "no-longer-human-zh-p00210",
      "unit_index": 6,
      "source_text": "「太好了！特別喜歡吃蠶豆。」",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "\"Wonderful! I especially love broad beans.\"",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "no-longer-human-zh-p00210",
      "unit_index": 7,
      "source_text": "他交叉的雙手枕在腦後，仰躺在地上。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "He lay on the floor on his back, his clasped hands behind his head.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "no-longer-human-zh-p00210",
      "unit_index": 8,
      "source_text": "「你好像對罪沒什麼興趣。」",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "\"You do not seem very interested in sin.\"",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "no-longer-human-zh-p00210",
      "unit_index": 9,
      "source_text": "「當然啦，因為我不像你是個罪人。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "\"Of course not, because I am not a sinner like you.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "no-longer-human-zh-p00210",
      "unit_index": 10,
      "source_text": "就算我吃喝嫖賭，也不會害死女人，更不會勒索女人的錢財。」",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Even if I drink, gamble, and chase women, I do not drive women to their deaths, much less extort money from them.\"",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
